<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18655" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαρναί</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶν</span>,
			αἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Acharnae,</i> a famous deme of Attica, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.19s
			</span></i>q.: mdash;<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">&amp;Ἀχαρνεύς,</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, ὁ,
				<i>inhabitant of Acharnae,</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαρνῆς,</span> title of play by <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i>: poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαρνηΐδαι</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				322
			</span></i>:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαρνικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				180
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀ. κισσός,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κορυμβίας</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.18.6
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαρνίτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, κισσός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.21
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Simm.
			</span></i>):—Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαρνῆσι</span></b> 
			<i>at Acharnae,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Icar.</u>
				18
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαρνῆθεν</span></b> 
			<i>from Acharnae,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				41.18
			</span></i>.</div>
